Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.85,0:00:07.62,Voz,,0,0,0,,El Maestro de las Llaves tiene que elegir una Cerradura en 30 segundos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.29,0:00:10.13,Voz,,0,0,0,,30,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:11.39,Voz,,0,0,0,,29,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:12.53,Voz,,0,0,0,,28,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:13.63,Voz,,0,0,0,,27,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:14.80,Voz,,0,0,0,,26,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:16.09,Voz,,0,0,0,,25,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:17.17,Voz,,0,0,0,,24,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:18.34,Voz,,0,0,0,,23,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:19.37,Voz,,0,0,0,,22,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:20.48,Voz,,0,0,0,,21,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.49,0:00:22.44,Voz,,0,0,0,,20,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:25.44,Capi,,0,0,0,,Si no elijo a alguien... Todos morimos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:30.51,Capi,,0,0,0,,Justo como le pasó a la presidenta del consejo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.59,0:00:38.05,Voz,,0,0,0,,17,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.05,0:00:38.62,Voz,,0,0,0,,16,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:39.59,Capi,,0,0,0,,¿Qué debería hacer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.71,0:00:39.79,Voz,,0,0,0,,15,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:40.74,Voz,,0,0,0,,14,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.74,0:00:41.94,Voz,,0,0,0,,13,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:42.76,Capi,,0,0,0,,¿A quién elijo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:43.19,Voz,,0,0,0,,12,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.19,0:00:44.36,Voz,,0,0,0,,11,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:45.43,Voz,,0,0,0,,10,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.43,0:00:46.70,Voz,,0,0,0,,9,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.71,0:00:47.71,Voz,,0,0,0,,8,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.71,0:00:48.71,Voz,,0,0,0,,7,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.71,0:00:49.74,Voz,,0,0,0,,6,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.74,0:00:50.89,Voz,,0,0,0,,5,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.89,0:00:52.07,Voz,,0,0,0,,4,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.07,0:00:53.04,Voz,,0,0,0,,3,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.04,0:00:53.99,Voz,,0,0,0,,2,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:55.06,Voz,,0,0,0,,1,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.84,0:00:55.97,Capi,,0,0,0,,Makiba Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:00:59.34,Capi,,0,0,0,,¿Cómo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.68,0:01:00.98,Capi,,0,0,0,,¿Yo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:05.48,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡No, no quiero!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:09.12,Capi,,0,0,0,,Aunque seas Takato...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:11.25,Capi,,0,0,0,,Yo, yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:14.66,Capi,,0,0,0,,Es mi primera vez.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:17.99,Voz,,0,0,0,,5,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.99,0:01:18.84,Voz,,0,0,0,,4,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.84,0:01:19.94,Voz,,0,0,0,,3,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:20.94,Voz,,0,0,0,,2,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:22.29,Voz,,0,0,0,,1,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.47,0:01:23.93,Capi,,0,0,0,,Aoi Natsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:30.17,Capi,,0,0,0,,E-Está bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.17,0:01:34.41,Capi,,0,0,0,,Tampoco es que pueda dejar a las chicas hacerlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.41,0:01:36.48,Capi,,0,0,0,,Es mi trabajo como su profesora.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.75,0:01:40.58,Capi,,0,0,0,,Además, tú también eres una víctima en esto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.59,0:01:43.12,Capi,,0,0,0,,¿Verdad, Takato?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.29,0:01:46.89,Capi,,0,0,0,,Sí.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:58.74,título,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2000,1000)\pos(969.013,1033.5)\fs50}~ Makiba Rika, Aoi Natsuki y el Capítulo del Resucitado Rostro del Infierno ~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:09.35,Capi,,0,0,0,,T-Takato, sé que eres bueno...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.35,0:02:12.28,Capi,,0,0,0,,No me vas a hacer nada malo, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.95,0:02:19.69,Capi,,0,0,0,,Takato, nunca me elegirías, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.69,0:02:22.43,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Creo en ti!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.66,0:02:26.36,Capi,,0,0,0,,El significado escondido \Ndetrás de esas palabras,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:28.53,Capi,,0,0,0,,era algo que Makiba nunca entendió.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.37,0:02:35.07,Capi,,0,0,0,,Que estaba bien para las demás, \Nmientras que ella no fuera violada.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.71,0:02:38.74,Capi,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:40.58,Capi,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.71,0:02:44.18,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Por favor, perdóname!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:56.23,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Voy... Voy a morirme!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.13,0:03:01.10,Capi,,0,0,0,,Haré lo que sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:03.90,Capi,,0,0,0,,Así que por favor...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:09.97,Capi,,0,0,0,,¿En serio piensa que será \Nperdonada en este punto?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:11.78,Capi,,0,0,0,,Está...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.72,0:03:20.62,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Ta-Takato, te lo suplico!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.62,0:03:22.29,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Te lo suplico, por favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.29,0:03:23.25,Capi,,0,0,0,,Quiero
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.82,0:03:27.76,Capi,,0,0,0,,verte sufrir de dolor bajo el agua.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.66,0:03:29.66,Cartel,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H1B38FF&\shad4\4c&HA6A6B2&\pos(458,150)}Cerradura: Vagina
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.66,0:03:29.69,Cartel,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H1B38FF&\shad4\4c&HA6A6B2&\pos(474,412)}Eyaculaciones: Una
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.66,0:03:29.69,Cartel,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H1B38FF&\shad4\4c&HA6A6B2&\pos(400,666)}Método: Duro
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.76,0:03:32.76,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡No, no...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:45.81,Capi,,0,0,0,,Mi...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.81,0:03:47.61,Capi,,0,0,0,,Mi virginidad ha-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.78,0:03:51.11,Capi,,0,0,0,,Es terrible...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.85,0:03:57.55,Capi,,0,0,0,,Makiba... ¡así que era \Nverdad que es tu primera vez!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.13,0:04:05.40,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Duele...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:09.07,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Me... me muero!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.67,0:04:11.84,Capi,,0,0,0,,No te vas a morir por esto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.84,0:04:14.50,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Duele, duele!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.51,0:04:16.31,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Me duele mucho, por \Nfavor, no sigas empujando eso!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:17.97,Capi,,0,0,0,,No lo llames 'eso'.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.98,0:04:19.61,Capi,,0,0,0,,Es mi polla.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.61,0:04:22.31,Capi,,0,0,0,,Mi polla está empujando dentro de ti.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.92,0:04:28.28,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Por favor, saca tu polla, duele de verdad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:31.52,Capi,,0,0,0,,Mi conejo se... se va a romper...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:33.09,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Se va a romper!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:34.89,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Se va a...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:40.83,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Me voy a ahogar, por \Nfavor, no me empujes tanto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:43.83,Capi,,0,0,0,,No puedo parar...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.83,0:04:46.50,Capi,,0,0,0,,Violar mujeres sienta genial.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.24,0:04:50.41,Capi,,0,0,0,,Incluso follarme este coño joven,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.41,0:04:54.54,Capi,,0,0,0,,está justificado porque al fin y al \Ncabo, están hechas para que las folles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.91,0:04:59.38,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Se está haciendo más grande...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:06.69,Capi,,0,0,0,,Si se hace más grande...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.69,0:05:09.83,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Creo que me va a desgarrar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:13.13,Capi,,0,0,0,,¿Se ha hecho más grande? \N¿Sabes lo que significa, Makiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:16.10,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Está a punto de soltarlo todo dentro de ti!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:19.04,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:24.24,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Si te corres dentro, me quedaré embarazada!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:25.64,Capi,,0,0,0,,Bien, tienes razón.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:26.71,Capi,,0,0,0,,Pero lo haré igualmente.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:29.98,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Me voy a correr dentro de ti!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:31.85,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡No, por favor, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:34.65,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡Por favor no te corras!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.65,0:05:36.49,Capi,,0,0,0,,¡No quiero quedarme embarazada!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:38.96,Capi,,0,0,0,,Aún no hemos cumplido la condición.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:40.20,Cartel,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H1B38FF&\shad4\4c&HA6A6B2&\pos(458,150)}Cerradura: Vagina
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:40.20,Cartel,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H1B38FF&\shad4\4c&HA6A6B2&\pos(474,412)}Eyaculaciones: Una
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:40.20,Cartel,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H1B38FF&\shad4\4c&HA6A6B2&\pos(400,666)}Método: Duro
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.21,0:05:40.25,Cartel,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H1B38FF&\shad4\4c&HA6A6B2&\move(458,150,458,-100)}Cerradura: Vagina
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.21,0:05:40.30,Cartel,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H1B38FF&\shad4\4c&HA6A6B2&\move(474,412,474,-100)}Eyaculaciones: Una
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.21,0:05:40.38,Cartel,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H1B38FF&\shad4\4c&HA6A6B2&\move(400,666,400,-100)}Método: Duro
